B.WC=new A.dL("inspect-washer-door-click","Check that the door latches","Do not bypass the door switch or probe latch wiring. No live electrical testing.","Close the door or lid all the way. Press at the handle until you feel or hear one solid click at the latch (front-load: catch at the right of the opening; top-load: lid catch). Nothing should be caught in the seal.",u.g,"It springs back, will not click, or something in the seal keeps it from latching.","washer","washer-door-click",B.j3,B.a2M,"washer-door-click")
