B.Wt=new A.dL("inspect-dishwasher-spray","Look at the spray-arm holes","Open the door and look. Do not reach inside while it is running. Unplug before you later lift a spray arm. Do not open a sealed pump. No live electrical testing.","With the door open, look along the lower (and upper, if present) spray arm. Holes should be open, not packed with food or mineral crust. Dishes should not be stacked so they block the arm from spinning.","Spray-arm holes look open and the load is not packed against the arms.","Holes look clogged with food, or the load is packed so water cannot reach the dishes.","dishwasher","dishwasher-spray-holes",B.dE,B.l9,"dishwasher-spray-holes")
