B.Wv=new A.dL("inspect-fridge-temps","Look at the temperature controls","This is a look-only check. Do not open the sealed cooling system. No live electrical testing. No compressor live diagnostics.","Find the fridge and freezer temperature dials or digital setpoints (inside the fresh-food side or on the dispenser). See whether they sit near the middle of the range, not the warmest or coldest stop.","Both controls sit in a normal mid-range \u2014 not at the warmest or coldest stop.","A control is at the warmest or coldest stop, or you cannot tell where it is set.","fridge","fridge-temps-or-settings",B.aez,B.a9i,"fridge-temps-or-settings")
